##: {{ux|en|There's blood '''running''' down your leg.}}
##: {{ux|en|The current '''runs''' to the toaster.}}
##: {{ux|en|My eyes were watering and now tears are '''running''' down my cheeks.}}
## {{lb|en|intransitive|figuratively}} To move or [[spread]] quickly.
