##: {{ux|en|Why is the hose still '''running'''?}}
## {{lb|en|transitive}} To make a liquid or electric current flow from or into an object.
##: {{ux|en|'''Run''' the water out into the pool.}}
##: {{ux|en|They '''ran''' the electricity back behind the wall.}}
## {{lb|en|intransitive}} To become [[liquid]]; to [[melt]].
